# SheetDB Configuration
# 1. Create a Google Sheet with headers: Date, Name, Company Name, Job Title, Email, Phone, Business Channel, Message
# 2. Go to https://sheetdb.io and create an API by pasting your Google Sheet URL
# 3. Copy your API URL or ID and paste below:
SHEETDB_API_URL=https://sheetdb.io/api/v1/your_sheetdb_api_id

# Optional: If you enabled HTTP Basic Authentication or Bearer Token in SheetDB settings
# SHEETDB_BEARER_TOKEN=

# Optional: Separate SheetDB endpoint or sheet for newsletter subscriptions
# SHEETDB_NEWSLETTER_API_URL=
